# game/story_main_04.rpy:8
translate english shopping_mall_scene_8df4cb83:

    # user "Das Einkaufszentrum war voll, laut und bunt. Genau das Gegenteil von unserem stillen Café heute Morgen."
    user "The mall was crowded, loud, and colorful. The exact opposite of our quiet café this morning."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:10
translate english shopping_mall_scene_237874e1:

    # user "Ich blieb vor dem großen Brunnen im Eingangsbereich stehen."
    user "I stopped in front of the large fountain in the entrance area."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:12
translate english shopping_mall_scene_6c5d6d12:

    # user "\"Okay Leute. Der Plan ist folgender: Ich muss dringend noch Deko für das Café besorgen. Ihr habt Freizeit.\""
    user "\"Okay guys. Here's the plan: I urgently need to get some decorations for the café. You have free time.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:13
translate english shopping_mall_scene_aa9324f9:

    # user "\"Wir treffen uns in zwei Stunden wieder hier.\""
    user "\"We'll meet back here in two hours.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:18
translate english shopping_mall_scene_69caec35:

    # user "Velvette scannte bereits die Schaufenster mit einem Kennerblick."
    user "Velvette was already scanning the shop windows with an expert eye."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:20
translate english shopping_mall_scene_74a43786:

    # v "\"Deko... sicher. Aber weißt du, was noch dringender dekoriert werden muss?\""
    v "\"Decorations... sure. But do you know what needs decorating even more urgently?\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:21
translate english shopping_mall_scene_83564e9c:

    # user "Sie zeigte mit einem manikürten Finger direkt auf mich."
    user "She pointed a manicured finger directly at me."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:22
translate english shopping_mall_scene_9bcbc310:

    # v "\"Du. Da hinten ist eine Boutique, die FAST meinen Standards entspricht. Ich brauche jemanden, der mir Sachen hält. Und vielleicht lasse ich dich auch etwas anprobieren.\""
    v "\"You. There's a boutique back there that ALMOST meets my standards. I need someone to hold things for me. And maybe I'll let you try something on too.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:26
translate english shopping_mall_scene_96c72b4a:

    # user "Macoi hingegen starrte wie hypnotisiert auf ein riesiges Filmplakat an der Wand."
    user "Macoi, on the other hand, was staring at a huge movie poster on the wall as if hypnotized."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:27
translate english shopping_mall_scene_deca97d4:

    # user "Seine Augen, sonst immer halb geschlossen, waren weit aufgerissen. Er wirkte... wach. Wirklich wach."
    user "His eyes, usually half-closed, were wide open. He seemed... awake. Genuinely awake."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:29
translate english shopping_mall_scene_e3c63d7a:

    # m "\"Cyber-Slayer: The Movie...\""
    m "\"Cyber-Slayer: The Movie...\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:30
translate english shopping_mall_scene_7afcccb6:

    # user "Er flüsterte es fast ehrfürchtig."
    user "He whispered it almost reverently."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:31
translate english shopping_mall_scene_a588c4c5:

    # m "\"Die Kritiken sagen, sie haben die Lore ruiniert. Ich muss es sehen. Ich muss mich darüber aufregen. Sofort.\""
    m "\"The reviews say they ruined the lore. I have to see it. I have to get mad about it. Immediately.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:36
translate english shopping_mall_scene_c979961e:

    # user "Lavan stand ebenfalls vor den Kinoplakaten, rümpfte aber die Nase über Macois Wahl."
    user "Lavan was also standing in front of the movie posters, but wrinkled his nose at Macoi's choice."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:37
translate english shopping_mall_scene_70e81232:

    # l "\"Videospiele... Kinderkram. Wenn wir schon ins Kino gehen, dann in etwas mit Substanz.\""
    l "\"Video games... kids' stuff. If we're going to the movies, it should be something with substance.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:38
translate english shopping_mall_scene_98430b4e:

    # user "Sein Blick huschte immer wieder zu einem Plakat mit einem sehr kitschigen Sonnenuntergang und einem sich küssenden Paar: 'Liebe im Sturm'."
    user "His gaze kept darting to a poster with a very cheesy sunset and a kissing couple: 'Love in the Storm'."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:39
translate english shopping_mall_scene_a5b92f07:

    # user "\"Du willst 'Liebe im Sturm' sehen, Lavan?\""
    user "\"You want to see 'Love in the Storm', Lavan?\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:41
translate english shopping_mall_scene_ec1ced1d:

    # l "\"WAS?! Nein! Ich rede von... der... der kinematographischen Ästhetik!\""
    l "\"WHAT?! No! I'm talking about... the... the cinematographic aesthetics!\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:43
translate english shopping_mall_scene_566c4554:

    # user "Er lief rot an und wedelte wild mit den Händen."
    user "He turned red and waved his hands wildly."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:44
translate english shopping_mall_scene_77c82b54:

    # l "\"Es geht um die Charakterentwicklung! Und die... Lichtverhältnisse! Das verstehst du nicht! Aber jemand muss ja mitkommen, um den Film objektiv zu bewerten!\""
    l "\"It's about the character development! And the... lighting conditions! You wouldn't understand! But someone has to come along to evaluate the movie objectively!\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:50
translate english shopping_mall_scene_fdd36d3b:

    # user "Cino drehte sich währenddessen im Kreis und staunte über die gläserne Decke."
    user "Meanwhile, Cino spun around in circles, marveling at the glass ceiling."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:52
translate english shopping_mall_scene_c3c2d05a:

    # c "\"Wow! So viele Lichter! Und es riecht nach Popcorn und Parfüm gleichzeitig!\""
    c "\"Wow! So many lights! And it smells like popcorn and perfume at the same time!\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:53
translate english shopping_mall_scene_4fd31ce6:

    # c "\"Ich will einfach überall rein! In den Spielzeugladen! In den Kerzenladen! Und da hinten gibt es Eis! [player_name], komm, wir erkunden einfach alles!\""
    c "\"I just want to go everywhere! Into the toy store! Into the candle store! And there's ice cream back there! [player_name], come on, let's just explore everything!\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:56
translate english shopping_mall_scene_8e246b84:

    # user "Ich sah in die Runde. Vier erwartungsvolle Gesichter, auch wenn zwei davon so taten, als wäre es ihnen egal."
    user "I looked around the group. Four expectant faces, even if two of them pretended they didn't care."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:57
translate english shopping_mall_scene_34224bfc:

    # user "Ich kann mich nicht zerteilen. Ich muss mich entscheiden."
    user "I can't split myself into four. I have to make a decision."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:94
translate english mall_date_velvette_eac4dc22:

    # user "\"Ich komme mit dir, Velvette. Jemand muss ja aufpassen, dass du den Laden nicht kaufst.\""
    user "\"I'll go with you, Velvette. Someone has to make sure you don't buy the entire store.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:98
translate english mall_date_velvette_fab8803a:

    # v "\"Eine weise Entscheidung. Komm, Darling. Wir haben Arbeit vor uns.\""
    v "\"A wise decision. Come along, darling. We have work to do.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:102
translate english mall_date_velvette_7d0e49b3:

    # user "Eine halbe Stunde später stand ich in einer Umkleidekabine, während Velvette mir Kleidungsstücke hineinreichte."
    user "Half an hour later, I was standing in a fitting room while Velvette handed me clothes."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:106
translate english mall_date_velvette_6827fde9:

    # v "\"Probier das Grüne. Nein, warte. Grün beißt sich mit deiner Aura. Nimm das Blaue.\""
    v "\"Try the green one. No, wait. Green clashes with your aura. Take the blue one.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:108
translate english mall_date_velvette_93e1e7f5:

    # user "Ich trat heraus. Velvette musterte mich kritisch, legte den Kopf schief und ging langsam um mich herum."
    user "I stepped out. Velvette inspected me critically, tilted her head, and slowly walked around me."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:109
translate english mall_date_velvette_1b891894:

    # user "Ich fühlte mich wie ein Gemälde, das begutachtet wird."
    user "I felt like a painting being evaluated."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:111
translate english mall_date_velvette_df6f369b:

    # user "\"Und? Urteil?\""
    user "\"Well? Verdict?\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:115
translate english mall_date_velvette_4b27f94c:

    # v "\"Hmpf.\""
    v "\"Hmph.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:116
translate english mall_date_velvette_ffc52d0e:

    # user "Sie trat näher an mich heran und zupfte den Kragen zurecht. Ihre Berührung war überraschend sanft."
    user "She stepped closer to me and adjusted the collar. Her touch was surprisingly gentle."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:118
translate english mall_date_velvette_1ef50371:

    # v "\"Es ist... akzeptabel. Es betont deine Augen.\""
    v "\"It's... acceptable. It brings out your eyes.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:119
translate english mall_date_velvette_682fa7d2:

    # user "Sie traf meinen Blick im Spiegel und lächelte. Ein echtes, kleines Lächeln, nicht ihr übliches Grinsen."
    user "She met my gaze in the mirror and smiled. A genuine, small smile, not her usual smirk."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:121
translate english mall_date_velvette_a8d6226b:

    # v "\"Du siehst gut aus. Fast so gut wie ich. Aber gewöhn dich nicht daran, dass ich dir Komplimente mache.\""
    v "\"You look good. Almost as good as me. But don't get used to me giving you compliments.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:123
translate english mall_date_velvette_191c2683:

    # user "Wir kauften das Teil und Deko für den Laden, die Velvette aussuchte, weil mein Geschmack 'fragwürdig' sei."
    user "We bought the piece, as well as decorations for the shop that Velvette picked out because my taste was supposedly 'questionable'."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:131
translate english mall_date_lavan_d27f4663:

    # user "\"Okay, Lavan. Lass uns die... 'Lichtverhältnisse' in diesem Film analysieren.\""
    user "\"Okay, Lavan. Let's analyze the... 'lighting conditions' in this movie.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:135
translate english mall_date_lavan_d195b1de:

    # l "\"Gute Wahl. Du wirst sehen, man kann viel lernen. Rein akademisch natürlich.\""
    l "\"Good choice. You'll see, there's a lot to learn. Purely academic, of course.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:143
translate english mall_date_lavan_217ec447:

    # user "Wir saßen im dunklen Kinosaal. Der Film war triefend kitschig. Die Heldin rannte im Regen dem Helden hinterher."
    user "We were sitting in the dark movie theater. The movie was dripping with cheese. The heroine was running after the hero in the rain."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:145
translate english mall_date_lavan_be246ce3:

    # user "Ich schielte zu Lavan rüber. Er starrte gebannt auf die Leinwand. Er hatte vergessen, sein Popcorn zu essen."
    user "I peeked over at Lavan. He was staring at the screen, completely captivated. He had forgotten to eat his popcorn."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:149
translate english mall_date_lavan_af8040c4:

    # l "\"Warum rennt sie nicht schneller? Der Zug fährt gleich ab! Das ist dramaturgisch völlig unlogisch!\" flüsterte er aufgebracht."
    l "\"Why isn't she running faster? The train is about to leave! Dramaturgically, that's completely illogical!\" he whispered indignantly."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:151
translate english mall_date_lavan_fed53165:

    # user "\"Lavan... weinst du?\""
    user "\"Lavan... are you crying?\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:153
translate english mall_date_lavan_66d1a346:

    # l "\"WAS?! Nein!\""
    l "\"WHAT?! No!\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:154
translate english mall_date_lavan_4b164582:

    # user "Er wischte sich hastig über die Augen."
    user "He hastily wiped his eyes."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:155
translate english mall_date_lavan_6e383604:

    # l "\"Es ist die Klimaanlage! Sie bläst mir direkt ins Auge! Und... und das Licht ist einfach zu grell!\""
    l "\"It's the AC! It's blowing directly into my eye! And... and the light is just too bright!\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:157
translate english mall_date_lavan_151bdb4b:

    # user "Auf der Leinwand küsste sich das Paar endlich. Lavan schniefte leise."
    user "On screen, the couple finally kissed. Lavan sniffled quietly."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:159
translate english mall_date_lavan_f6c09088:

    # user "Ich griff in die Popcorn-Tüte, und unsere Hände berührten sich. Lavan zuckte zusammen, zog seine Hand aber nicht weg."
    user "I reached into the popcorn bag, and our hands touched. Lavan flinched, but didn't pull his hand away."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:163
translate english mall_date_lavan_954f948a:

    # l "\"Tsk. Iss ruhig. Ich kann mich bei dem Kitsch eh nicht auf Essen konzentrieren...\""
    l "\"Tsk. Go ahead and eat. I can't concentrate on food with all this cheese anyway...\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:164
translate english mall_date_lavan_a58331dc:

    # user "Er drückte meine Hand ganz kurz, bevor er sie losließ."
    user "He squeezed my hand very briefly before letting go."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:174
translate english mall_date_macoi_21218b9d:

    # user "\"Macoi, ich will sehen, wie sehr sie die Lore ruiniert haben. Ich komm mit.\""
    user "\"Macoi, I want to see how much they ruined the lore. I'm coming with you.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:178
translate english mall_date_macoi_cb207aee:

    # m "\"Ja! Endlich jemand mit Kultur.\""
    m "\"Yes! Finally someone with culture.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:179
translate english mall_date_macoi_efaaeea7:

    # user "Er packte mich fast schon am Arm und zog mich Richtung Kasse. So schnell hatte ich ihn noch nie gesehen."
    user "He practically grabbed my arm and dragged me toward the ticket counter. I had never seen him move so fast."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:187
translate english mall_date_macoi_fe572ebf:

    # user "Der Film war laut, bunt und voller Explosionen. Für mich war es reines Chaos."
    user "The movie was loud, colorful, and full of explosions. For me, it was pure chaos."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:188
translate english mall_date_macoi_321684a9:

    # user "Aber für Macoi war es eine Offenbarung."
    user "But for Macoi, it was a revelation."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:190
translate english mall_date_macoi_5586f891:

    # user "Er lehnte sich immer wieder zu mir rüber und flüsterte mir Erklärungen ins Ohr. Sein Gesicht war im Licht der Leinwand hellwach."
    user "He kept leaning over to me and whispering explanations into my ear. His face was wide awake in the light of the screen."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:194
translate english mall_date_macoi_6be29fdd:

    # m "\"Siehst du das Schwert? Im Spiel kriegst du das erst nach 50 Stunden Grind. Hier hat er es in Szene 1. Lächerlich. Aber die Grafik ist geil.\""
    m "\"Do you see that sword? In the game, you only get that after a 50-hour grind. Here, he has it in Scene 1. Ridiculous. But the graphics are sick.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:196
translate english mall_date_macoi_1d008fc3:

    # user "Ich hörte ihm lieber zu als dem Film. Seine Begeisterung war ansteckend."
    user "I preferred listening to him over the movie. His enthusiasm was contagious."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:198
translate english mall_date_macoi_8eabdf44:

    # user "\"Du magst das Spiel wirklich, oder?\""
    user "\"You really like this game, don't you?\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:200
translate english mall_date_macoi_5a43630a:

    # m "\"Es ist... meine Welt. Wenn die echte Welt zu laut ist.\""
    m "\"It's... my world. When the real world is too loud.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:204
translate english mall_date_macoi_36de76d9:

    # user "Er sah mich an, und für einen Moment vergaß er den Film."
    user "He looked at me, and for a moment he forgot about the movie."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:206
translate english mall_date_macoi_847654b1:

    # m "\"Aber es ist cool, dass du mitgekommen bist. Alleine nerden macht nur halb so viel Spaß. Hier, nimm meine Nachos. Die mit dem Käse.\""
    m "\"But it's cool that you came along. Nerding out alone is only half as fun. Here, have my nachos. The ones with cheese.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:207
translate english mall_date_macoi_9f2ddfc3:

    # user "Er schob mir die Schale hin. Von Macoi war das der ultimative Liebesbeweis."
    user "He pushed the bowl toward me. Coming from Macoi, this was the ultimate declaration of love."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:217
translate english mall_date_cino_89ee5081:

    # user "\"Ich glaube, ich brauche etwas Bewegung. Komm Cino, wir ziehen los.\""
    user "\"I think I need some exercise. Come on Cino, let's head out.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:221
translate english mall_date_cino_08325d84:

    # c "\"Juhu! Abenteuerzeit!\""
    c "\"Yay! Adventure time!\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:225
translate english mall_date_cino_1473d199:

    # user "Es war weniger ein gezieltes Einkaufen und mehr ein Zick-Zack-Lauf durch alle möglichen Läden."
    user "It was less of a targeted shopping trip and more of a zigzag run through all sorts of stores."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:226
translate english mall_date_cino_69a3ef73:

    # user "Wir rochen an Duftkerzen, welche Cino zum niesen brachten, probierten lustige Sonnenbrillen auf und standen lange vor einem Tierladen."
    user "We smelled scented candles that made Cino sneeze, tried on funny sunglasses, and stood in front of a pet store for a long time."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:228
translate english mall_date_cino_676a1d1c:

    # user "Schließlich landeten wir in einem Deko-Laden."
    user "Finally, we ended up in a home decor store."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:232
translate english mall_date_cino_07968523:

    # c "\"Oh! [player_name], guck mal!\""
    c "\"Oh! [player_name], look!\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:233
translate english mall_date_cino_57a66508:

    # user "Er hielt eine kleine, leuchtende Figur hoch. Es war eine Katze, die eine Kaffeetasse hielt."
    user "He held up a small, glowing figure. It was a cat holding a coffee cup."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:235
translate english mall_date_cino_4285b557:

    # c "\"Die sieht aus wie wir! Also... wie das Café! Können wir die holen? Als Glücksbringer?\""
    c "\"It looks like us! I mean... like the café! Can we get it? As a lucky charm?\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:237
translate english mall_date_cino_728dfd78:

    # user "\"Sie passt eigentlich gar nicht zum Stil...\""
    user "\"It doesn't really fit the aesthetic at all...\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:241
translate english mall_date_cino_6f3458db:

    # c "\"Bitteeee! Sie passt zu uns, weil sie fröhlich ist!\""
    c "\"Pleeaase! It fits us because it's happy!\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:242
translate english mall_date_cino_14bd85af:

    # user "Er schaute mich mit diesen unwiderstehlichen Hundeaugen an."
    user "He looked at me with those irresistible puppy dog eyes."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:244
translate english mall_date_cino_627b0465:

    # user "\"Na gut. Gekauft.\""
    user "\"Alright. Bought.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:248
translate english mall_date_cino_50051538:

    # c "\"Ja!\""
    c "\"Yes!\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:249
translate english mall_date_cino_02618457:

    # user "Er umarmte mich stürmisch mitten im Laden."
    user "He hugged me fiercely right in the middle of the store."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:250
translate english mall_date_cino_c23ccb03:

    # c "\"Das wird unser Maskottchen! Danke! Das ist der beste Ausflug aller Zeiten!\""
    c "\"This will be our mascot! Thank you! This is the best trip ever!\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:264
translate english mall_reunite_8cdbf791:

    # user "Zwei Stunden später trafen wir uns alle wieder am Brunnen."
    user "Two hours later, we all met back at the fountain."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:266
translate english mall_reunite_afdc0010:

    # user "Ich hatte meine Deko-Tüten und vielleicht ein paar Extras in der Hand."
    user "I had my decoration bags and maybe a few extras in my hand."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:271
translate english mall_reunite_074bf298:

    # user "Lavan und Macoi kamen aus dem Kino. Sie stritten immer noch."
    user "Lavan and Macoi came out of the cinema. They were still arguing."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:273
translate english mall_reunite_86f5c6a0:

    # l "\"Der Film hatte null emotionale Tiefe!\""
    l "\"The movie had zero emotional depth!\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:274
translate english mall_reunite_d105cd2c:

    # m "\"Er hatte Laser-Drachen. Dein Argument ist ungültig.\""
    m "\"It had laser dragons. Your argument is invalid.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:278
translate english mall_reunite_011fa85b:

    # user "\"Alle glücklich? Alle bereit für den Heimweg?\""
    user "\"Is everyone happy? Everyone ready to head home?\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:282
translate english mall_reunite_fc605758:

    # v "\"Meine Füße tun weh. Ich verlange einen sehr bequemen Sitz im Auto.\""
    v "\"My feet hurt. I demand a very comfortable seat in the car.\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:287
translate english mall_reunite_4804a0b0:

    # c "\"Ich hab Hunger! Können wir die Deko essen? Nein? Okay...\""
    c "\"I'm hungry! Can we eat the decorations? No? Okay...\""

# game/story_main_04.rpy:289
translate english mall_reunite_0a7bca5f:

    # user "Ich lachte. Es fühlte sich gut an."
    user "I laughed. It felt good."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:290
translate english mall_reunite_07a0c342:

    # user "Vielleicht wird das mit dem Café doch was. Wir sind ein seltsamer Haufen, aber irgendwie... passt es."
    user "Maybe this café thing will work out after all. We're a weird bunch, but somehow... it fits."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:296
translate english mall_reunite_135332a0:

    # user "Ich ließ mich rücklings auf mein Bett fallen und starrte die Decke an."
    user "I fell flat on my back onto my bed and stared at the ceiling."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:300
translate english mall_reunite_b89414a6:

    # user "Meine Füße pochten ein wenig von der Lauferei, aber es war ein angenehmer Schmerz."
    user "My feet throbbed a little from all the walking, but it was a pleasant pain."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:302
translate english mall_reunite_fe17901e:

    # user "Das Einkaufszentrum... der Lärm, die vielen Menschen, das Chaos mit den Vieren."
    user "The mall... the noise, the crowds of people, the chaos with the four of them."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:304
translate english mall_reunite_2c8bc619:

    # user "Es war anstrengend. Aber es war auch... schön."
    user "It was exhausting. But it was also... nice."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:306
translate english mall_reunite_6fd84655:

    # user "Ich drehte mich auf die Seite und zog die Decke bis zum Kinn."
    user "I rolled onto my side and pulled the blanket up to my chin."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:308
translate english mall_reunite_deb2b99d:

    # user "Vor allem dieser eine Moment ging mir nicht mehr aus dem Kopf."
    user "Especially this one moment that I couldn't get out of my head."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:319
translate english mall_reunite_3db02e54:

    # user "Lavan im Kino..."
    user "Lavan at the movies..."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:320
translate english mall_reunite_f8d5589b:

    # user "Er hat so getan, als würde er den Film hassen. Als wäre es Folter für ihn."
    user "He acted as if he hated the movie. Like it was torture for him."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:321
translate english mall_reunite_efaac15a:

    # user "Aber ich habe gesehen, wie er sich die Augen gewischt hat."
    user "But I saw him wipe his eyes."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:322
translate english mall_reunite_854cde90:

    # user "Und als sich unsere Hände im Popcorn berührt haben... er hat nicht zurückgezogen."
    user "And when our hands touched in the popcorn... he didn't pull away."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:323
translate english mall_reunite_eb0c4c8e:

    # user "Er hat sogar kurz zugedrückt."
    user "He even squeezed it briefly."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:324
translate english mall_reunite_ef61a7c8:

    # user "Vielleicht ist er gar nicht so stachelig, wie er immer tut. Vielleicht braucht er nur jemanden, der sich nicht an seinen Dornen stört."
    user "Maybe he's not as prickly as he acts. Maybe he just needs someone who doesn't mind his thorns."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:325
translate english mall_reunite_8d71a804:

    # user "Ein kleines Lächeln stahl sich auf meine Lippen. Sein Gesicht, als er rot wurde... niedlich."
    user "A small smile crept onto my lips. His face when he blushed... cute."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:333
translate english mall_reunite_a4cb6d94:

    # user "Velvette in der Boutique..."
    user "Velvette in the boutique..."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:334
translate english mall_reunite_c4c1d255:

    # user "Ich musste grinsen. Sie hat mich herumkommandiert wie eine Anziehpuppe."
    user "I had to grin. She bossed me around like a dress-up doll."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:335
translate english mall_reunite_82c59c68:

    # user "Aber da war dieser eine Moment vor dem Spiegel."
    user "But there was that one moment in front of the mirror."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:336
translate english mall_reunite_19edc745:

    # user "Sie hat mich nicht als Projekt gesehen. Sie hat *mich* angesehen."
    user "She didn't see me as a project. She looked at *me*."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:337
translate english mall_reunite_eaecb7bf:

    # user "Ihr Kompliment war echt. Hinter all dem Glitzer und der Arroganz steckt jemand, der einfach nur Perfektion sucht, auch in Beziehungen."
    user "Her compliment was genuine. Behind all the glitter and arrogance is someone who is simply looking for perfection, even in relationships."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:338
translate english mall_reunite_d668f149:

    # user "Und dass sie mich 'akzeptabel' fand... aus ihrem Mund ist das wohl die größte Liebeserklärung."
    user "And that she found me 'acceptable'... coming from her, that's probably the biggest declaration of love."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:346
translate english mall_reunite_f3568d2a:

    # user "Macoi im Kino..."
    user "Macoi at the movies..."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:347
translate english mall_reunite_f39df63c:

    # user "Ich habe ihn noch nie so lebendig gesehen. Seine Augen haben geleuchtet."
    user "I've never seen him so alive. His eyes were shining."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:348
translate english mall_reunite_9a2eae95:

    # user "Normalerweise schläft er im Stehen, aber wenn es um Dinge geht, die er liebt, ist er voll da."
    user "He usually sleeps on his feet, but when it comes to things he loves, he's fully there."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:349
translate english mall_reunite_e1d02820:

    # user "Und er hat seine Nachos mit mir geteilt. Seine heiligen Nachos."
    user "And he shared his nachos with me. His sacred nachos."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:350
translate english mall_reunite_abe171eb:

    # user "Es hat sich so... natürlich angefühlt. Als würden wir schon immer nebeneinander sitzen."
    user "It felt so... natural. As if we had always been sitting next to each other."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:351
translate english mall_reunite_7663253a:

    # user "Er braucht keine großen Worte. Seine Nähe reicht völlig aus."
    user "He doesn't need big words. His presence is completely enough."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:359
translate english mall_reunite_c1a7eb7c:

    # user "Ich blickte auf den Nachttisch. Da stand sie. Die kleine, kitschige Katzenfigur."
    user "I looked at the nightstand. There it was. The small, cheesy cat figurine."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:360
translate english mall_reunite_0fa5e49c:

    # user "Cino..."
    user "Cino..."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:361
translate english mall_reunite_9bce0843:

    # user "Er ist pures Chaos, aber er ist auch pure Freude."
    user "He's pure chaos, but he's also pure joy."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:362
translate english mall_reunite_f4baec18:

    # user "Wie er durch den Laden gehüpft ist, völlig ohne Scham, einfach nur glücklich, mit mir dort zu sein."
    user "The way he skipped through the store, completely without shame, just happy to be there with me."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:363
translate english mall_reunite_c1877a80:

    # user "Seine Begeisterung ist ansteckend. Wenn ich bei ihm bin, wird die Welt ein bisschen heller."
    user "His enthusiasm is contagious. When I'm with him, the world gets a little brighter."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:364
translate english mall_reunite_d2be67ca:

    # user "Er hat gesagt, das ist unser Maskottchen. 'Unseres'."
    user "He said it's our mascot. 'Ours'."

# game/story_main_04.rpy:365
translate english mall_reunite_cb45a728:

    # user "Der Gedanke ließ mein Herz schneller schlagen."
    user "The thought made my heart beat faster."

